WEBVTT

NOTE Machine transcription from the supplied MP3; may contain recognition or alignment errors.

g11-audio-11-1
00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:06.360
Unit 11, Dreams.

g11-audio-11-2
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:07.800
Good morning.

g11-audio-11-3
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:15.420
Today, I'd like to talk about the importance of having big dreams in life and to urge you to dream big.

g11-audio-11-4
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:20.840
First, I'd like to tell you, what exactly a big dream is.

g11-audio-11-5
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:28.140
A big dream is a large and important wish, or an ambition or something you often think about,

g11-audio-11-6
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.380
because you would like it to happen.

g11-audio-11-7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.960
When you achieve it, it would fulfill or satisfy your desire.

g11-audio-11-8
00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:38.780
A big dream can also be a powerful idea.

g11-audio-11-9
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:44.480
It is often said that the size of our success is measured by the size of our dream.

g11-audio-11-10
00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:53.020
To some, a big dream is a vision of the future, a vision that both scares and excites you at the same time.

g11-audio-11-11
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:59.540
It brings out your passion, imagination, creativity and a willingness to take risks.

g11-audio-11-12
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:06.180
We can see the final destination in our minds eye, and it motivates and empowers us.

g11-audio-11-13
00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:10.300
A big dream is something that can make us and things better.

g11-audio-11-14
00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:14.680
Second, we have desires that we want to fulfill in life.

g11-audio-11-15
00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:17.760
Different people have different dreams.

g11-audio-11-16
00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:26.160
A dream could range from something as simple as wanting to pass an examination to something like becoming a millionaire.

g11-audio-11-17
00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:33.740
Some people dream of getting a job, getting a degree, buying an expensive car or a grand house,

g11-audio-11-18
00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:42.900
getting married, having children, getting a promotion, starting a business, inventing something, traveling around the world,

g11-audio-11-19
00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.600
becoming famous and many others.

g11-audio-11-20
00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:48.660
We can have an endless list of dreams.

g11-audio-11-21
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:55.220
Thirdly, I'd like to urge you to allow yourself to dare to dream big dreams.

g11-audio-11-22
00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:59.780
Whatever your dream is, you should own it and be proud of it.

g11-audio-11-23
00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:05.400
Then, implement it bravely and keep working on your plans until they are complete.

g11-audio-11-24
00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:12.750
Walt Disney, thus, claims that all our dreams can come true if we have the courage to pursue them.

g11-audio-11-25
00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:18.330
You must create your own personal success in life and dare to dream big.

g11-audio-11-26
00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:21.470
Every great achievement begins with a dream.

g11-audio-11-27
00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:27.230
Decide what you want, write it down, make a plan, and then take action.

g11-audio-11-28
00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:35.310
To sum up, I'd like to remind you that dreaming is important, but having to implement the dream is more important.

g11-audio-11-29
00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:41.730
Try to follow your dreams boldly, know your strengths and take up the challenge to succeed.

g11-audio-11-30
00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:45.630
You should realize that there's a long road ahead.

g11-audio-11-31
00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:49.370
However, over time your dream will come true.

g11-audio-11-32
00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.730
It doesn't happen overnight.

g11-audio-11-33
00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:54.710
But, eventually it will happen.
